cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "pulswave: pulsed transverse liquid-jet actuation of oblique detonation waves"
abstract: "Two-dimensional Eulerian-Lagrangian study of an n-heptane spray oblique detonation wave (ODW) anchored by a transverse liquid jet when the jet is switched off, pulsed or throttled: how long the base holds after the jet stops, which pulse frequencies and duty cycles keep it held, and whether pulsing or throttling at half the fuel does. Benchmarked against a published continuous-jet baseline."
